  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Consists of a single scroll formed from joined sheets of white bond paper. The text is the poem "Eternidad" hand-written in Spanish, English and French and framed with colored hand-painted borders. The scroll also contains full-color hand-painted illustrations, some using cutouts and collage elements. When rolled up the scroll is secured with a separate hand-painted wrapper.</subfield>
